{"id":"n-20261005-m2pwmy","category":"gaming","display_title":"Dungeons & Dragons World of Warcraft","display_title_he":"מבוכים ודרקונים: וורלד אוף וורקראפט","short_summary":"Wizards of the Coast has unveiled Dungeons and Dragons: World of Warcraft, a massive tabletop expansion bringing the lore, geography, and creatures of Azeroth to the RPG.","english_level":"C1","words":297,"reading_time":2,"image":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/AD%26D_Dungeon_Masters_notebook.jpg/960px-AD%26D_Dungeon_Masters_notebook.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Steve Jurvetson · CC BY 2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:AD%26D_Dungeon_Masters_notebook.jpg"},"sources":[{"name":"Polygon","domain":"polygon.com","url":"https://www.polygon.com/lanterns-season-2-release-date-plot","title":"'Lanterns' Season 2 Confirmed? Potential Release Date, Plot, and Everything You Need to Know","published_at":"2026-10-05T17:51:14.000Z"},{"name":"IGN","domain":"ign.com","url":"https://www.ign.com/articles/dungeons-and-dragons-world-of-warcraft-everything-you-need-to-know","title":"Dungeons and Dragons: World of Warcraft – Everything You Need to Know","published_at":"2026-10-05T16:00:00.000Z"}],"published_at":"2026-10-05T16:00:00.000Z","first_published_in_app_at":"2026-10-05T19:24:31.702Z","quality_score":9,"interest_score":9,"verification_status":"verified","content_status":"published","paragraphs":["Wizards of the Coast has introduced Dungeons and Dragons: World of Warcraft, marking the first Universes Beyond release for the famous tabletop role-playing game. According to developers, this expansive new book feels like an entire game in its own right, packed with deep lore, intricate dungeons, and crafting professions that span the history of Azeroth up to The War Within. Although the tabletop adventure is massive, it focuses exclusively on the planet of Azeroth, omitting other cosmic locations.","Game designers explained that the expansion is carefully structured to fit Dungeons and Dragons rules while staying true to the source material. Each zone on Azeroth is assigned a specific level range, mirroring the video game, though Dungeon Masters retain the ultimate power to customize their campaigns. To make out-of-order campaigns make sense, the book introduces a clever narrative device called Chromie Time, allowing characters to travel across different eras of history.","When it comes to exploring dungeons and raids, the gameplay shifts significantly from the video game format. Instead of rushing through enemies and defeating bosses rapidly, players are encouraged to approach environments with patience, utilizing stealth or diplomacy. For instance, players might sneak past pirates in the Deadmines or choose between fighting a boss and helping an ogre king in Dire Maul. High-level encounters, which function as raids, feature epic bosses like Onyxia, translated into exciting tabletop challenges.","Furthermore, the expansion features a vast bestiary with full statistics and histories for iconic characters such as Arthas, Jaina Proudmoore, and Sylvanas. Developers noted that creatures and dragons from Azeroth possess unique abilities and lore distinct from standard Dungeons and Dragons monsters. Additionally, the inclusion of gathering and crafting professions allows players to utilize simplified rules based on gold piece values to create potions and items during their adventures."],"facts":[{"fact":"Wizards of the Coast announced Dungeons and Dragons: World of Warcraft as a major Universes Beyond expansion for the tabletop RPG.","sources":[2]},{"fact":"The expansion covers the planet of Azeroth up to The War Within, incorporating major lore, historical conflicts, dungeons, and professions.","sources":[2]},{"fact":"Tabletop dungeons in D&D: WoW are designed for slower, non-linear exploration and stealth rather than standard video game speed runs.","sources":[2]},{"f